      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\begin{cases}(1-2y)^2-3(1-2y)y-2y^2+5(1-2y)-7y+10=0,\\\\↵x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简第一个方程后，方程组具有下列形式：",
        "$\\begin{cases}y^2-3y+2=0,\\\\↵x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由二次方程$y^2-3y+2=0$得出$y=1$或$y=2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，",
        "$\\begin{cases}y=1,\\\\↵x=1-2y\\end{cases}$　或　$\\begin{cases}y=2,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，",
        "$\\begin{cases}x=-1,\\\\↵y=1\\end{cases}$　或　$\\begin{cases}x=-3,\\\\y=2.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "答：$\\{(-1,1),(-3,2)\\}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "代入消元法和图解法、加减消元法一样，也可以用来解二",
        "元线性方程组."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果方程组是由两个二次方程组成的，那么只有在特殊情况下，才",
        "能给出它的简单解法."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程组",
        "$\\begin{cases}x^2-3y^2=22,\\\\↵xy=21.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在方程组的第二个方程中，用$y$表示变量$x$并将所得到的式子代",
        "入第一个方程，得到方程组",
        "$\\begin{cases}x^2-3\\cdot\\left(\\frac{21}{x}\\right)^2=22,\\\\↵y=\\frac{21}{x}.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
